DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     This function is used to obtain information about the objects using mem‐
     ory in the system.

     The _c_n_t_p argument allows the caller to know how many records are re‐
     turned.

     This function is a wrapper around the “vm.objects” sysctl(3) MIB.  While
     the kernel returns a packed structure, this function expands the data
     into a fixed record format.

